  <div class="importance">
       <div id="important" class="text-importance">
             <h2 class="subheading">IMPORTANCE</h2>
             <p>There are a lot of great reasons why one should cultivate this crop</p>
             <ul class="list" type="disc">
                 <li>It can tolerate low rainfall and shortage of water.</li>
                 <li>It performs well in a wide variety of soils, and being a legume.</li>
                 <li>It replenishes low fertility soils when the roots are left to decay, which makes it an ideal crop for crop rotation.</li>
             </ul>
